ognition relate</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/part/1/chapter/1/crossheading/delegation-of-secretary-of-states-functions-in-relation-to-auditors"><em>Delegation of Secretary of State’s functions in relation to auditors</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/3">Delegation of functions by Secretary of State to new or existing body</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/4">Circumstances in which Secretary of State may delegate functions to existing body</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/5">Supplementary provisions about delegation orders</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/part/1/chapter/1/crossheading/auditors-qualifications"><em>Auditors' qualifications</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/section/6">Approval of overseas qualifications for auditors</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2004/27/part/1/chapter/1/crossheading/services-provided-by-auditors"><em>Services provided by auditors</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="L